# Lesson 31.5 (extension) - HCN -> HNC isomerisation: nudged elastic band + TS search with GFN2-xTB.
# The two xyz files list the atoms in the same order (C, N, H); NEB needs that.
# ORCA 6.1.1:  orca 05_hcn_hnc_nebts.inp > 05_hcn_hnc_nebts.out   (about a minute)
! XTB2 NEB-TS Freq
%neb
  NEB_End_XYZFile "../molecules/hnc.xyz"
  NImages 8
end
* xyzfile 0 1 ../molecules/hcn.xyz
